      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ana%20Cabral-Gardner\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ana Cabral-Gardner</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2021 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Executive Officer and Co-Chairperson</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Co-founder of Sigma Lithium. Over 25 years of experience in capital markets and M&A. Previously at Goldman Sachs and Barclays.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Caio%20de%20Moraes\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Caio de Moraes</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2023 June)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Extensive experience in mining operations and project management in Brazil.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Matthew%20DeYoe\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Matthew DeYoe</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2024 May)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President, Corporate Strategy and Investor Relations</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former equity research analyst covering the chemicals and lithium sectors.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ana%20Cabral-Gardner\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ana Cabral-Gardner</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2018 May)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Co-Chairperson</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Co-founder and CEO of Sigma Lithium.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Marcelo%20Paiva\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Marcelo Paiva</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2018 May)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Co-Chairperson</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Co-founder of A10 Capital. Extensive experience in private equity and capital markets.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alexandre%20de%20L'Etraz\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alexandre de L'Etraz</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2018 May)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Experienced in international finance and wealth management.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Vicente%20Lobo\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Vicente Lobo</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2021 July)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Secretary of Geology, Mining and Mineral Processing of Brazil.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1751788/000110465924076321/tm2418461d1_6k.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">SEC Form 6-K - Management Information Circular</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-06-30)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sigmalithiumresources.com/about-us/management-team/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Company Website - Management